# Local secrets for `bun run dev`. `bun install` creates .dev.vars from this
# file and adds any variable set here that .dev.vars lacks. Each change-me
# value becomes a random one.

# The app's Turso database. Leave both unset to use the local file
# .data/local.db instead. They can also come from the environment.
# TURSO_DATABASE_URL=libsql://<database>-<org>.turso.io
# TURSO_AUTH_TOKEN=
